FIELDRUNNERS · 坚守阵地 复刻版
================================

This repository is a non-commercial tribute / fan re-implementation of the
game "Fieldrunners", originally developed by Subatomic Studios.

- The gameplay mechanics and visual style are inspired by the original game.
- All source code and all artwork in this repository are independently
  implemented. Artwork is generated procedurally at runtime; no asset from
  the original game is included or redistributed.
- "Fieldrunners" and its original assets are the property of
  Subatomic Studios. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.
- This project is provided for learning and personal use only.
  Commercial use is not permitted.

The MIT license below applies to the original source code of this repository.

